# Elrond, Moon-Reader: "{5}{U}{U}: Exile up to two other target nonland permanents you control. Return those cards to the battlefield under their
# owner's control at the beginning of the next end step." On turn 3 Bot1 pays {5}{U}{U} with four Moxen and a Black Lotus (seven mana, the pool empty
# after; Elrond's own first ability triggers on it and draws, resolving first); the refusals: Elrond himself, an Island, and Bot2's Mox Jet are not legal targets. Ornithopter and Mox Ruby, the latter already tapped for the
# cost, are exiled and are back (Mox Ruby untapped, a new object) at the beginning of the end step: they are not on the battlefield before it
